A Review on Various Aspects of Jarosite and Its Utilization Potentials
Nasim Eftekhari1, Mohammad Kargar2*, Farokh Rokhbakhsh Zamin1, Nahid Rastakhiz3, Zahra Manafi4
1

Department of Microbiology, Kerman Branch, Islamic Azad University, Kerman 7635131167, Iran
